      "type": "MetaHolonType.MetaTypeDescriptor",
      "properties": {
        "TypeName": "MetaDesignSystem",
        "TypeNamePlural": "MetaDesignSystems",
        "DisplayName": "Meta Design System",
        "DisplayNamePlural": "Meta Design Systems",
        "Description": "A versioned semantic presentation contract that selects the reusable DesignTokens in its vocabulary. It tells Canvas and Visualizer developers which semantic decisions they may rely on, and Theme developers the complete set they must assign. Multiple MetaDesignSystems may include the same DesignToken, so membership is not token ownership. MetaDesignSystem is a MAP-native composition concept: DTCG standardizes design-token concepts and formats, not a Meta Design System entity. A changed token-role meaning requires a new MetaDesignSystem version."
      },
